              "expr": {
                "Literal": {
                  "Value": "'Column chart of the share of films reaching 2.5 times their budget, by budget band. The share is 65.8% under 1 million dollars, falls to its low of 33.5% in the 15 to 30 million band, and recovers to 53.3% for films of 100 million and above. Removing the highest-earning 5% of films within each band leaves this U-shape intact.'"
